<title>CHILE: Chilean bottler Andina Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Chilean bottler Andina Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's main Coca-Cola bottler Embotelladora Andina SA reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>			   Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p>   Net profit	     12.4			17.3</p>
<p>   Operating profit	9.3			 7.9</p>
<p>   Non-operating profit  4.5			10.8</p>
<p>   Total revenues	 38.5			32.5</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
